# Caddy site block for briefs.automatisierbar.ch — company briefs (Hub M9).
#
# Same host-prefix pattern as walkin.automatisierbar.ch: the subdomain reverse-proxies to the
# shared cockpit Flask app on :8082, which dispatches by request.host (api.py index()) and serves
# each brief at its unguessable /b/<token>.html URL. There is deliberately NO directory index —
# briefs hold confidential client info and are reachable only via their token URL (embedded in the
# Hub client page + linked from the "Brief ist bereit" inbox notification).
#
# Prereqs before appending this to /etc/caddy/Caddyfile:
#   1. DNS A-record:  briefs.automatisierbar.ch -> 187.124.188.2
#   2. Then:  caddy validate --config /etc/caddy/Caddyfile && systemctl reload caddy
# Until DNS + this block exist, briefs are still reachable at cockpit.automatisierbar.ch/b/<token>.html
# (BRIEF_BASE_URL defaults to the cockpit host). Flip BRIEF_BASE_URL to https://briefs.automatisierbar.ch
# in /etc/cockpit/env once this is live.

briefs.automatisierbar.ch {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8082
}
